  "label": "Product Mockery Through Absurdity",
  "description": "The humor in the meme is derived from mocking a product (or idea) by making it absurdly ridiculous. This is a common comedic strategy in advertising and satire, where the exaggeration of a product’s features or functions is used to highlight its flaws or impracticality. The viewer must understand this comedic trope to fully appreciate the meme.",
